'''Novalia International Airport''' {{Airport codes|NVA|SHAA|}}, also known as '''Alessandria International Airport''', or '''Alessandria-Novalia''', is an [[W:International airport|international airport]] serving [[Alessandria]] ([[Hesperia]]) and the wider [[Augusta Corridor|Augustine megalopolis]]. The airport is located on an [[W:Artificial island|artificial island]] in [[Kalu-Tywyra|Kalutiwira Bay]], {{convert|6|km|mi|spell=}} northeast of [[Alessandria|downtown core]] of Alessandria. The airport is ranked the second busiest airport in Balisca in terms of passenger traffic, after [[Concordia International Airport|Concordia International]].

